    {
        "content": "<p>It wants 2026.7 and only 2026.2 is on Docker</p>",
        "id": 616167404,
        "sender_full_name": "Ash Manda",
        "timestamp": 1786564141
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>So someone needs to push a 2026.7 image</p>",
