        "timestamp": 1786564562
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>we can absolutely build it locally and tag it exactly like it expects</p>",
        "id": 616168945,
        "sender_full_name": "Ash Manda",
        "timestamp": 1786564705
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Right, but can we build gdcc/base locally, before building the app image.</p>\n<p>That's what I do on my laptop to test Payara upgrades: build the base image first. Like this: <a href=\"https://guides.dataverse.org/en/6.11/container/base-image.html#build-instructions\">https://guides.dataverse.org/en/6.11/container/base-image.html#build-instructions</a></p>",
