        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin 🚀",
        "timestamp": 1786564711
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Here too: <a href=\"https://guides.dataverse.org/en/6.11/container/dev-usage.html#building-your-own-base-image\">https://guides.dataverse.org/en/6.11/container/dev-usage.html#building-your-own-base-image</a></p>\n<p>\"If you find yourself tasked with upgrading Payara (or reviewing or testing such an upgrade), you will need to create your own base image\"</p>",
